              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naajoki ninye nanu, “Enkerai e tung'ani, inosa ina nikinchooki iyie; inosa ele piyayati le mbuku, nilo airorie enkaji e Israel.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa atabolo nanu enkutuk ai, naaisho ninye nanu olpiyayati le mbuku mainosa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naajoki ninye nanu, “Enkerai e tung'ani, inosa ele piyayati le mbuku laaisho iyie nimput enkoshoke ino ninye.” Metaa ainosa ninye; naa ore etii enkutuk nemelok anaa olkenkei le naisho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naajoki ninye nanu, “Enkerai e tung'ani, shomo, tabaiki enkaji e Israel, niro too rorei laainei airorie ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu eitu kirriwari iyie aairriwaki iltung'ana le likae ng'ejep o enkutuk nagol enkiroroto, kake enkaji e Israel ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neme iloreren kumok loo lng'ejepa oopaashaa o enkutuk nagol, ilaa mining'u irorei lenye. Esipa tenaairriwaki iyie kulo, naa aikindim aatoning'u iyie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore enkaji e Israel nimikinining iyie; amu meyieu ninche naaning nanu amu ore enkaji pooki e Israel naa inoo logol lukuny negolong'u iltauja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ing'ura ajo aitaa elukunya ino enagol anaa ilukuny enye, naitagol elukunya ino anaa ilukuny enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anaa enagol osoit oji almasi alang isoito aitaa elukunya ino neijia; miureyu ninche tukul, nimimputukuny too nking'urat enye, amu enkaji kiserut ninche.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aanyaaka ake sii ajoki nanu, “Enkerai e tung'ani, ore irorei laainei pooki lelo laaliki iyie tang'amai toltau lino nining'u too nkiyiaa inono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nilo enetii iltung'ana linono ootii eararoto nijoki ninche, inji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai; toliki ninche ening o meyieu nening.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina peyie aadumu enkiyang'et nanu ailepie, ore edumunye enkitoo o Laitoriani te wueji enye, naning te siadi nanu oltoilo sapuk le nkirikirata enkop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa oltoilo loo naipuko e nena ng'uesi naaishu eibung'a maate, naning sii nena kejek oo ngarrin naashepita te mbata enye, nening'oyu anaa olokirikiri sapuk le nkop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naadumu ina Kiyang'et nanu ailepie naaya, nalo te mion enkirowuaj oltau lai, eiroishi ina aina te shumata nanu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nalotu enetii lelo yarunot te Telabib, lelo ootii enkiyopata olkeju le Keba. Naton teine atunume tenebo ninche nkolong'i naapishana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etegelua Olaitoriani Esekiel metaa olarriponi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore peyie eishunye inkolong'i naapishana, nelotu ororei lo Laitoriani enatii nejo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Enkerai e tung'ani, aaitaa iyie olarriponi te nkaji e Israel; ore ake pooki kata nining ororei eing'uaa enkutuk ai, nincho ninche enkikoo naing'uaa enatii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tenajoki ilo torrono, ‘Meeta nchere aimiye,’ neitu inkok ninye aliki, neitu iro aikok ilo torrono metung'uai enkoitoi enye torrono, peyie etum aitajeu enkishui enye, keye oltung'ani torrono too ntorrok enyena; kake ore osarge lenye naa kaing'oru te nkaina ino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake tininkok ilo torrono, nemeibelekenya ninye aing'uaa ntorrok enyena, arashu too nkoitoi enyena, naa keye ninye too ng'ok enyena; kake intajewuo iyie enkishui ino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore ake sii, teneibelekenya oltung'ani supat aing'uaa esupatisho enye neas intorrok, napik entoki narror dukuya enye, naa keye ninye; amu eitu inkok iyie ninye, keye ninye too ng'ok enyena, ore isiaaitin enyena sidain nena naataasa nemeitokini aadamu; kake ore osarge lenye nayieu too nkaik inono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore ake eyia, tininkok ilo tung'ani supat peyie meas eng'oki, neitu eas eng'oki, nemeeta nchere meton eishu, amu etang'amayie ninye enkikoo; nintajeu iyie enkishui ino.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Keaku Esekiel olemeidim airoro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netii apa enkaina Olaitoriani shumata nanu; naajoki nanu, “Tudumunye shomo enkisiajata peyie aatum airorie teine.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa atudumunye nalo enkisiajata; naa ng'ura, neitashe enkitoo o Laitoriani teine, neikununo anaa enkitoo apa natoduaa te nkiyopata olkeju le Keba; nabatata te nkomom ai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake aatijing'a Enkiyang'et nanu, naadumu aitasheyie too nkejek; naairorie nanu naajoki, “Shomo inkenoi kewan tiatua enkaji ino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
