        {
          "text": "Kake tenaairorie iyie, naabol iyie enkutuk, naa aijoki iyie ninche, ‘Inji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai;’ ore ilo oning, inchoo ening; ore ilo oany ening, inchoo eany amu enkaji kiserut ninche.",
